# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt), the fired-up route. The same start; at the fork take
# the low lane, through its quick nugget line (fired up is the counter filled last), call the
# band (Down) as the line ends, hop the fan pit, and jump the canal's long gaps between its
# islands with the fired-up stride (jump, toot as he starts to fall; the islands' nuggets keep
# the band hot). Over the bank's hole and the exit hole, then the last stretch fired up: hover
# in each fan (let go of Right over it), toot off it onto the crumbling ledge, leap the mesa's
# fan and stone at once, the vent's gust, and the climb out: stone, fan, stone, fan, stone.
